{"unit_id":"montersy123__dsh-skill-market#card-card-zh","repo":"montersy123/dsh-skill-market","commit":"4cda93094d9c147e1774e39a8d88581264862d4c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-market（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在侧边栏提供 Skill Market 面板，连接 SkillHub 技能目录。用户可以按分类浏览、搜索和查看技能详情，也能收藏条目、查看文件与版本、安装指定技能或导入本地 ZIP。已安装列表支持更新、启用、停用和卸载；Host 会把启用的技能注册到 DSH 当前会话。适合想在 Harness 中发现并管理可调用技能的用户。使用时需要访问 api.skillhub.cn；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-4","lib/index.js:2501-2519","lib/client.js:5697-5728"]}
{"unit_id":"montersy123__dsh-skill-market#card-card-en","repo":"montersy123/dsh-skill-market","commit":"4cda93094d9c147e1774e39a8d88581264862d4c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Browse and search SkillHub skills, inspect details, save favourites, install skills, and import ZIPs in a sidebar panel. Manage installed skills with update, enable, disable, or uninstall; enabled skills register in DSH sessions. Web client; needs api.skillhub.cn access, no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-4","lib/index.js:2501-2519","lib/client.js:5697-5728"]}
